{"text": "納期ちょっと巻きでお願いできますか？", "field": "practical", "must_any": ["earlier", "sooner", "ahead of", "speed up", "faster", "move up"], "must_not": ["extend", "extension", "delay", "later", "postpone"]}
{"text": "その件は一旦持ち帰らせてください。", "field": "practical", "must_any": ["consider", "discuss", "get back", "check internally", "take it back", "review"], "must_not": ["take home", "bring home", "takeout", "take-out"]}
{"text": "本日、傘のお忘れ物が多くなっております。", "field": "practical", "must_any": ["umbrella"], "must_not": []}
{"text": "残高不足のため、口座振替ができませんでした。再度の引き落としは行いませんので、下記の窓口までお支払いください。", "field": "practical", "must_any": ["insufficient", "not enough", "balance"], "must_not": ["will retry", "will be debited again", "automatically retried"]}
{"text": "なるはやでご返信いただけると助かります。", "field": "practical", "must_any": ["as soon as possible", "asap", "quickly", "soon"], "must_not": []}
{"text": "只今、券売機で食券をお買い求めください。", "field": "practical", "must_any": ["ticket", "vending machine", "machine"], "must_not": []}
{"text": "明日のミーティング、リスケでお願いします。", "field": "practical", "must_any": ["reschedul", "move", "change the time", "new time"], "must_not": ["cancel"]}
{"text": "検診の前日は21時以降の飲食はお控えください。", "field": "practical", "must_any": ["9", "21"], "must_not": []}
{"text": "不在のためお荷物をお預かりしています。再配達のご依頼は下記QRコードから。", "field": "practical", "must_any": ["redeliver", "re-deliver", "delivery"], "must_not": []}
{"text": "こちらの商品は税抜価格です。", "field": "practical", "must_any": ["not include tax", "excludes tax", "excluding tax", "before tax", "plus tax", "tax will be added", "tax not included"], "must_not": []}
{"text": "会議の資料、前倒しで金曜までにお願いします。", "field": "practical", "must_any": ["earlier", "moved up", "friday", "ahead of schedule"], "must_not": ["postpon", "delay"]}
{"text": "エレベーター点検のため、下記時間帯は階段をご利用ください。", "field": "practical", "must_any": ["stairs", "elevator"], "must_not": []}
